---
name: on-save-lint
description: Run lint and typecheck on save for the NecroCode studio.
enabled: true
when:
  event: PostToolUse
  matcher: ".*"
then:
  type: command
  command: "npm run lint && npx tsc --noEmit"
---

# On Save Lint

- Fires after file-save tool activity.
- Runs `npm run lint` and `npx tsc --noEmit`.
- Contract: keep `npm run build` passing with zero TypeScript/ESLint errors.
